\" width=\"514\" height=\"40\" alt=\"Eschmeyer's Catalog of Fishes\"></td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n    <form action=\"fishcatmain.asp\" method=\"post\" style=\"margin:10px\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"line-height:200%\">Select the database to search:</span><br>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"line-height:200%\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"tbl\" value=\"Genus\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"searchhelp#SearchGenera\" target=\"_top\">GENERA</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"tbl\" value=\"Species\"\r\n\t\t\t\t checked\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"searchhelp#SearchSpecies\" target=\"_top\">SPECIES</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"tbl\" value=\"Ref\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"searchhelp#SearchReferences\" target=\"_top\">REFERENCES</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n<br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height:200%\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"unavailable\"  > Include unavailable names</span>\r\n<br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height:200%\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"contains\" size=\"75\" maxlength=\"100\" style=\"font-size:larger\"></span>\r\n<br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height:200%\"><input type=\"submit\" name=\"Submit\" value=\"Search\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"Reset\" name=\"Reset\">\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Comments:\r\n<!--\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script><!---\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdropmeanote('weschmeyer','William Eschmeyer',\"Eschmeyer's Catalog of Fishes\",'','','')//</script> -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script><!---\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdropmeanote('richard.vanderlaan','Richard van der Laan',\"Eschmeyer's Catalog of Fishes\",'','gmail','com')//---></script>, \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script><!---\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdropmeanote('ronfricke','Ron Fricke',\"Eschmeyer's Catalog of Fishes\",'','web','de')//---></script>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n      </form>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"20\" class=\"bodytext\">\r\n<tr><td>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr noshade size=1>\r\n<p class=\"result\" spid=\"23983\"><b><i>oschanini</i>, <i>Exostoma</i></b> Herzenstein [S. M.] 1889:70 [120] [Mélanges Biologiques, tirés du Bulletin physico-mathématique de l'Académie Impériale des Sciences de St. Pétersbourg v. 13; ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=18285\">18285</a>] Upper Amu-Darya River (country uncertain), upper Syr-Darya River basin (Ugam River, Tashkent), Uzbekistan. Syntypes: BMNH 1888.11.24.1 [ex ZIN] (1); ZIN 8055-57 (1, 1, 2). Type catalog: Ferraris 2007:126 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=29155\">29155</a>]. On p. 120 in Bull. Acad. Imp. Sci. St. Pétersb. (n. s.) v. 1:119-123.  Genus often seen as <i>Glyptosternum</i>. &bull;Synonym of <i>Glyptosternon reticulatum</i> McClelland 1842 -- (Berg 1949:921 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=20661\">20661</a>], Coad 1981:16 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=22348\">22348</a>], Talwar &amp; Jhingran 1991:642 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=20764\">20764</a>], Menon 1999:239 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=24904\">24904</a>], Thomson &amp; Page 2006:70 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=28859\">28859</a>]).  &bull;Species inquirena in Sisoridae -- (Ferraris 2007:402 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=29155\">29155</a>]).  &bull;Valid as <i>Glyptosternon oschanini</i> (Herzenstein 1889) -- (Thoni et al. 2017:436 [ref. <a href=\"getref.asp?id=35365\">35365</a>]). <b>Current status:</b> Valid as <i>Glyptosternon oschanini</i> (Herzenstein 1889). Sisoridae: Glyptosterninae. Distribution: Upper Syr Darya River basin, Uzbekistan and possibly Upper Amu Darya River basin, Kyrgyzstan. Habitat: freshwater.</p>\r\n\r\r\n\t<hr noshade size=1>\r\n\t</td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n  <!-- #EndEditable -->\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"20\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <a href=\"http://researcharchive.calacademy.org/research/capturenonpaged.asp?dbname=CoFWeb&object=spCoFSearch\"></a>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n